@UserManagementApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5247

### 1) Login and copy the "token" value from the response
POST {{UserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2) Call a protected endpoint with the token
@token = paste-token-here

GET {{UserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{UserManagementApi_HostAddress}}/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
